{"title":"2023 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/8/be8552ecdfa2e81447b42240f15cfeca7bf44ba7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$203$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> has an odd ones digit, an even tens digit, and an even hundreds digit. How many integers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> have an odd ones digit, an even tens digit, and an even hundreds digit?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Listing all of the numbers, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/1038785e77cdf7734f6ee2f8fed6de2ab19acc15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$201$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/8/be8552ecdfa2e81447b42240f15cfeca7bf44ba7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$203$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/d/45d2a7ea6cefb9ec19c